# DustSilica — Test Phase 7 respirable crystalline silica (RCS) diagnostics.
#
# Exercises RCS calculation from PM10 concentration:
#   - Phase 6:  saltation emission (test_ustar=0 -> emission from MRF u*)
#   - Phase 7:  silica RCS diagnostics enabled
#
# Expected results:
#   (1) Run exits code 0 at max_step=20.
#   (2) silica_diag.csv written with 20 rows
#   (3) rcs_max_mg_m3 >= 0
#   (4) All output files created with valid CSV headers.
#
# References:
#   29 CFR 1910.1053: https://www.osha.gov/silica-crystalline

